*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0039
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-08-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 552
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0039.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 WS-CSCR            PIC 9(3).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 G-INC              PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-CLIM            PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-CREDIT-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "WS-CLIM=" WS-CLIM
    STOP RUN.
3000-CREDIT-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 740
            COMPUTE WS-CLIM = G-INC * 0.30
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 640
            COMPUTE WS-CLIM ROUNDED = G-INC * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 500 TO WS-CLIM
    END-EVALUATE.
